      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ira%2C_Texas"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The community peaked in the early 20th century, reaching a population of 485 in 1980 before declining sharply in the following decades.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        15
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ira%2C_Texas"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "By 2000 Ira’s residents numbered about 250, a drop of nearly half from its 1980 peak.",
