      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ira%2C_Texas"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Ira sits on the Llano Estacado, near the Colorado River and close to Mushaway Peak, Duffy's Peak, and Farm to Market Road 669.",
